# Source CSVs — too large for git
*.csv

# Large sample JSONL files (one part is ~90MB, right at GitHub's 100MB limit).
# The dashboard works without them: the main view is driven by
# dataset_metadata.json (full-NYC stats, 1.6KB) and the data table reads
# df_records_preview.jsonl (~6MB) — both are committed.
#
# To regenerate locally for development:
#   cd frontend/public/data
#   awk 'NR % 15 == 1' df_clean_integrated_sample_part1.jsonl > df_records_preview.jsonl
frontend/public/data/df_clean_integrated_sample_part*.jsonl

